    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy is delighted to present this superb two-bedroom mid-terrace residence. This inviting home is nicly tucked away offering a warm and contemporary interior that is ready for immediate occupation. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and generously proportioned living room to the front, providing an ideal setting for relaxation. To the rear, a stylish kitchen/dining area forms the heart of the home, perfectly designed for both everyday living and entertaining, with direct access to the private rear garden. Upstairs, the property boasts two double bedrooms, each complete with built-in wardrobes, offering ample storage and comfort and a family bathroom. Externally, the property enjoys a private rear garden. To the front, convenient parking bays are available for residents and visitors alike.Ideally positioned in a quiet enclave, this home is perfectly suited as a starter property or for those seeking a peaceful yet well-connected setting. The location is excellent, with many amenities nearby including shops, schools, the beach, and Balbriggan train station, ensuring excellent connectivity. This is a truly impressive home that combines style, space, and location in equal measure."
      },
